          "html": "<p>本例三层宽度较大，未模拟薄互层或岩屑迟到校正；大平滑窗可能抹掉薄层。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-mud-logging\">SLB：录井、迟到与荧光概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html\">朴素贝叶斯原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"
